# src/apps/daemon/internal

## Purpose
Private daemon implementation organized by dependency band. Paths intentionally expose dependency direction, not feature popularity.

## Contents
- No direct source files; this folder is a namespace/organization node for child modules.
- Child folders: `adapters/`, `analysis/`, `foundation/`, `integrations/`, `native/`, `networking/`, `platform/`, `protocols/`, `runtime/`, `workflows/`.

## Interfaces and dependencies
- See direct files and parent context for the interface consumed by sibling/parent modules.

## Invariants
- Keep behavior local to the named module; move cross-cutting policy to its canonical owner instead of duplicating it here.

## Navigation
- Read this file first, then direct child `.context` files before editing a deeper folder.
- Update this context when ownership, supported interfaces, or child-folder meaning changes; do not use it as a changelog.
